{"symbol":"ACCORDTS","yahoo":"ACCORDTS.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Accord Transformer & Switchgear Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","website":"https://www.atsgroup.in","about":"Accord Transformer & Switchgear Limited engages in the design, engineering, testing, manufacturing, deployment, and supply of a diversified range of electrical power and distribution equipment in India. The company operates in the power transmission and distribution sector, renewable energy, industrial applications, infrastructure projects, and electric vehicle (EV) charging networks Its products include distribution transformers, power transformers, dry-type transformers, solar transformers, package substations, special-purpose transformers (wind inverter, furnace duty, solar inverter duty), low-voltage (LV) control panels, medium-voltage (MV) / Vacuum Circuit Breaker (VCB) panels, busducts, cable trays, and associated switchgear assemblies. It also offers control panels and switchgear including LV Control Switchboards, APFC panels, industrial panels, and customized prisma set control panels. Additionally, it provides compact and skid-mounted substations including unitized indoor/outdoor substations E-houses, bus-ducts and cable trays, EV charging stations, and other customized electrical solutions. Accord Transformer & Switchgear Limited was incorporated in 2014 and is based in Manesar, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:05:29+00:00","quote":{"price":86.04,"prevClose":76.66,"marketCap":177.01,"high52":88.5,"low52":45.0,"pe":29.67,"bookValue":23.75,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":12.8,"shares":2.0573,"insiders":71.7,"institutions":1.24},"prices":{"dates":["2026-03-02","2026-03-04","2026-03-05","2026-03-06","2026-03-09","2026-03-10","2026-03-11","2026-03-12","2026-03-13","2026-03-16","2026-03-17","2026-03-18","2026-03-19","2026-03-20","2026-03-23","2026-03-24","2026-03-25","2026-03-27","2026-03-30","2026-04-01","2026-04-02","2026-04-06","2026-04-07","202